# Experiment outputs. Regenerable, and archived under runs/ when they are not.
# Generated OUTPUT locations are ignored wholesale rather than by extension, so
# curated source data (data/handwritten/, the stimuli CSVs) stays tracked
# without needing negation rules.
data/results*/
data/directions*/
data/calibration*.json
data/stimuli/*.jsonl
data/smoke*/
data/local_*/
data/gemma3_12b/
data/gemma3_27b*/
figures*/
